      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791186553740,
      "created": 1791184925661,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Histoire SGBDR - SQL\n - 1970s : recherche IBM\n    * modèle relationnel (algèbre)\n    * langage SEQUEL => SQL : Structured Query Language\n    * prototype\n - 1979 : 1er SGBDR commercial Oracle => Oracle Database\n - 1986 : Standard SQL \n    * dernière version 2023\n    * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SQL\n - éditeurs:\n    * Oracle Database : 19c, 26ai \n    * Microsoft SQL Server : 2022, 2025\n    * PostgreSQL (opensource)\n    * MySQL (Oracle) / MariaDB\n    * SQLite\n    * ...",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Histoire SGBDR - SQL\n - 1970s : recherche IBM\n    * modèle relationnel (algèbre)\n    * langage SEQUEL => SQL : Structured Query Language\n    * prototype\n - 1979 : 1er SGBDR commercial Oracle => Oracle Database\n - 1986 : Standard SQL \n    * dernière version 2023\n    * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SQL\n - éditeurs:\n    * Oracle Database : 19c, 26ai \n    * Microsoft SQL Server : 2022, 2025\n    * PostgreSQL (opensource)\n    * MySQL (Oracle) / MariaDB\n    * SQLite\n    * ...",
      "autoResize": true,
